PROSE SUMMARY (context, not a substitute for the structured log above)
---------------------------------------------------------------------
35-turn game. Zikale's Elphidran Aqua destroyed Trxvor's Lyleen Noct early via a double-KO trade (turn 3). Several of Zikale's attacks were nullified by Trxvor's Cryolinx/Reindrix (turns 6, 12, 14, 18, 29) while Trxvor's own Elphidran Aqua attacks were bare-form interrupted by Zikale's Foxparks (turns 10, 22). Trxvor's Elphidran Aqua/Pengullet destroyed several of Zikale's threats via combat trades (turns 16, 26, 31). Zikale built a heavy Pump-Action Shotgun/Single-Shot Rifle buff engine on Elphidran, hitting Trxvor for 2 (turn 23) then finishing Lyleen Noct in a mutual trade before Jormuntide Ignis chipped Trxvor down (9->7->3, turn 26). Trxvor's Chillet/Astegon/Pengullet then ground Zikale from 10 down to 0 (turns 27, 33, 35).


